    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Novos Recursos / Conte\xFAdo</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Adicionado suporte ao idioma chin\xEAs tradicional."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Added Traditional Chinese language support."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.2
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.3
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Qualidade de Vida / Acessibilidade</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A lista de idiomas agora mostra o nome de cada idioma no seu
        pr\xF3prio idioma."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Language list now shows each language's name in your own
        language."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.5
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.6
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Corre\xE7\xF5es de Bugs</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Itens equipados em recarga n\xE3o duplicam mais ao serem movidos
        para o armazenamento."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Equipped items on cooldown no longer duplicate when moved
        into storage."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido: morrer com um painel aberto no multiplayer deixava
        a nave imortal."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed dying with a panel open in multiplayer leaving the
        ship immortal."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Arquivos salvos afetados pelo bug da nave imortal agora se recuperam
        ao reaparecer."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Saves affected by the immortal ship bug now recover on the
        next respawn."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Cifras de Portal extras inutiliz\xE1veis do multiplayer agora
        s\xE3o removidas automaticamente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Unusable extra Gateway Ciphers from multiplayer are now
        removed automatically."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigidas v\xE1rias tradu\xE7\xF5es incorretas no texto em
        chin\xEAs simplificado."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a number of mistranslations in the Simplified Chinese
        text."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Corre\xE7\xF5es de Bugs</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Desacoplar agora reconstr\xF3i a colis\xE3o do casco, permitindo
        que naves sem escudo coletem itens."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Undocking now rebuilds hull collision so shieldless ships
        can collect items."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro ao assumir um confronto em co-op com uma nave
        sob controle mental."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error taking over a co-op encounter holding a mind-controlled
        ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro ao mover uma arma de feixe espelhada para
        um slot n\xE3o espelhado."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error after moving a mirrored beam weapon to an
        unmirrored slot."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro quando um drone ou torre perdia uma pe\xE7a
        do casco com o tempo pausado."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a drone or turret lost a hull part while
        time was paused."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro ao entrar em uma sess\xE3o enquanto o anfitri\xE3o
        conclu\xEDa um confronto."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error joining a session while the host completed
        an encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Corre\xE7\xF5es de Bugs</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A troca de anfitri\xE3o em co-op n\xE3o coloca mais naves no
        esquadr\xE3o errado ap\xF3s uma invas\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Co-op host handoffs no longer put ships in the wrong squadron
        post-invasion."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Designs de nave agora dimensionam o escudo ao finalizar, corrigindo
        um erro ao fechar r\xE1pido."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship designs now size the shield on Finish, fixing an error
        when closed fast."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Invasores n\xE3o se espalham mais para um confronto em que um
        jogador em co-op est\xE1 entrando."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Invaders no longer spread to an encounter a co-op player
        is jumping into."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O teclado virtual agora fecha junto com seu painel de item,
        corrigindo um erro ao cancelar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 On-screen keyboard now closes with its item panel, fixing
        an error on Cancel."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Cr\xE9ditos guardados como item n\xE3o podem mais ser descartados."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Credits stored as an item can no longer be discarded or
        dropped."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Novos Recursos / Conte\xFAdo</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Jogadores da demo e do jogo completo agora veem os jogos Apenas
        amigos da Steam uns dos outros."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo and full-game players can now see each other's Steam
        Friends Only games."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A lista de jogos agora permite entrar em jogos com a porta do
        roteador fechada."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Games behind a closed router port can now be joined from
        the game list."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Jogos da demo agora se conectam pela Steam quando os dois jogadores
        t\xEAm a demo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo games now connect through Steam when both players own
        the demo."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.4
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.5
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Qualidade de Vida / Acessibilidade</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Tradu\xE7\xE3o para o espanhol revisada para um espanhol neutro
        da Espanha e da Am\xE9rica Latina."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Spanish translation revised to neutral Spanish for Spain
        and Latin America."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.7
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.8
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Corre\xE7\xF5es de Bugs</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Convites da Steam aceitos antes do carregamento do menu n\xE3o
        pulam mais a verifica\xE7\xE3o de vers\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Steam invites accepted before the menu loads no longer skip
        the version check."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Esquadr\xF5es inimigos n\xE3o perdem mais uma nave quando um
        jogador em co-op sai de um confronto."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy squadrons no longer lose a ship when a co-op player
        leaves an encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Jogos p\xFAblicos hospedados via IPv6 agora s\xE3o listados
        e podem ser acessados pela lista de jogos."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Public games hosted over IPv6 are now listed and joinable
        from the game list."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro de entrada ao sair de um jogo com um painel
        de nave ainda abrindo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an input error after leaving a game with a ship panel
        still opening."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.0
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Qualidade de Vida / Acessibilidade</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os erros de mods incompat\xEDveis agora nomeiam os mods ausentes,
        extras ou de vers\xE3o errada."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Mod mismatch errors now name the missing, extra or wrong-version
        mods."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As dicas na lista de jogos agora mostram os mods do anfitri\xE3o
        e destacam os diferentes."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Game list tooltips now show the host's mods and flag any
        that differ."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.3
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.4
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Desempenho</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Performance</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os dados de combate em co-op agora s\xE3o bem menores, ajudando
        jogadores com conex\xF5es fracas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Co-op combat data is now far smaller, helping players on
        weaker connections."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.6
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.7
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Corre\xE7\xF5es de Bugs</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os jogadores da Steam n\xE3o s\xE3o mais desconectados quando
        a conex\xE3o lenta congestiona."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Steam players are no longer dropped when a slow connection
        briefly backs up."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A m\xFAsica n\xE3o engasga mais em grandes combates, pois o
        limite de vozes de \xE1udio era baixo demais."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music no longer stutters in big fights, as the audio voice
        limit was too low."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os sons distantes agora somem por completo al\xE9m de 1,4 km
        em vez de persistirem baixinho."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Distant sounds now fade to silence beyond 1.4 km instead
        of lingering faintly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os controles deslizantes de volume agora se aplicam ao iniciar,
        e n\xE3o ap\xF3s salvar as configura\xE7\xF5es pela primeira vez."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Volume sliders now apply on launch instead of after the
        first settings save."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As torres das naves de IA agora voltam a apontar para a frente
        quando o alvo some."
      baseValue: "\u2022 AI ship turrets now swing back forward once their target
        is gone."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A contagem de inimigos do radar n\xE3o trava mais quando uma
        nave convertida entra em um esquadr\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar enemy count no longer freezes when a converted ship
        joins a squadron."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Chegar ao confronto de um amigo n\xE3o deixa mais sua nave branca
        e travada."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Arriving in a friend's encounter no longer leaves your ship
        white and stuck."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os tiros do Canh\xE3o Gravitacional agora explodem ao fim do
        voo, em vez de apenas sumir."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity Cannon shots now explode at the end of their flight,
        not just vanish."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Saltar entre confrontos com uma Matriz Vortex n\xE3o causa mais
        um erro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Jumping between encounters with a Vortex Array no longer
        causes an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.title
      type: 13
      value: Multiplayer
      baseValue: Multiplayer
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Novos Recursos / Conte\xFAdo</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Jogue online com amigos: multiplayer co-op para at\xE9 8 jogadores."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Play online with friends: co-op multiplayer for up to 8
        players."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os inimigos ficam mais fortes conforme o n\xFAmero de jogadores
        na sess\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemies scale in strength with the number of players in
        the session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A experi\xEAncia das mortes \xE9 compartilhada com jogadores
        no mesmo confronto."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Experience from kills is shared with players in the same
        encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Hospede sess\xF5es com nome, senha opcional, limite de jogadores
        e visibilidade."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Host sessions with a name, optional password, player cap,
        and visibility."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Encontre jogos pela lista p\xFAblica de jogos, busca em LAN,
        amigos da Steam ou IP."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Find games via the public game list, LAN discovery, Steam
        friends, or IP."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Aceite um convite da Steam para entrar direto na sess\xE3o de
        um amigo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Accept a Steam invite to jump straight into a friend's session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os jogos podem ser configurados para PVP / Saque compartilhado
        como desejar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Games can be set to PVP / Shared Loot as desired."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pilotos Hardcore e Normal podem jogar juntos na mesma sess\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hardcore and Regular pilots can play together in the same
        session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Chat de texto adicionado ao HUD nos jogos multiplayer, com novo
        atalho para ativar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Text chat added to HUD in multiplayer games with new keybinding
        to activate."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A lista de jogadores ao lado do Radar mostra o status e a localiza\xE7\xE3o
        dos outros jogadores."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Player list next to Radar shows other players' status and
        location."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Se o anfitri\xE3o desconectar, o jogo volta ao modo de um jogador
        sem interrup\xE7\xF5es."
      baseValue: "\u2022 If the host disconnects the game seamlessly drops back into
        single player."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A demo inclui multiplayer completo e pode entrar em sess\xF5es
        do jogo completo no Setor 1."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo includes full multiplayer and can join full-game sessions
        in Sector 1."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os di\xE1logos no multiplayer agora pausam o confronto para
        todos durante o combate."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dialogs in multiplayer now pause the encounter for everyone
        during combat."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os di\xE1logos no multiplayer avan\xE7am sozinhos por um tempo
        de leitura, para ningu\xE9m ficar travado."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Multiplayer dialogs auto-advance on a reading timer so no
        one stays frozen."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A lista de jogadores agora mostra quais jogadores est\xE3o lendo
        um di\xE1logo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Player list now shows which players are reading a dialog."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Novas dicas na lista de jogos multiplayer mostram nome, n\xEDvel
        e modo de cada jogador."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New multiplayer game list tooltips show each player's name,
        level, and mode."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os anfitri\xF5es agora podem remover ou banir jogadores com
        os comandos /kick e /ban no chat."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hosts can now kick or ban players with the /kick and /ban
        chat commands."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.18
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.19
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Mudan\xE7as de Balanceamento</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Balance Changes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os custos de aprimoramento de raridade no Montador foram reduzidos
        pela metade."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Rarity upgrade costs in the Assembler have been halved."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Sua nave n\xE3o pode mais ser destru\xEDda na frota, ent\xE3o
        reaparecer \xE9 sempre seguro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Your ship can no longer be destroyed at the fleet, so respawns
        are always safe."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Tocha Criog\xEAnica e Condu\xEDte Cin\xE9tico agora est\xE3o
        \xE0 venda na nave-m\xE3e."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cryo Torch and Kinetic Conduit are now available for sale
        in the mothership."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.23
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Aumentada em 40% a velocidade do Orbe Rel\xE2mpago de Mj\xF6lnir."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Increased speed of Mj\xF6lnir's Lightning Orb by 40%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.24
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Reduzida em 25% a regenera\xE7\xE3o de casco do Broodnest Species-XI."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Reduced Hull Regen of Species-XI Broodnest by 25%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
