    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os arquivos salvos com mods ausentes agora aparecem normalmente
        na lista, mostrando quais mods faltam."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Saves with missing mods now list normally, showing which
        mods are missing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As descri\xE7\xF5es dos itens foram corrigidas para melhorar
        a gram\xE1tica e a clareza."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Item descriptions have been corrected for grammar and clarity."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.29
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A tela de multiplayer da demo agora explica como hospedar e
        entrar em jogos do Setor 1."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo multiplayer screen now explains hosting and joining
        Sector 1 games."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.30
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O Canh\xE3o Gravitacional agora mostra uma amarra em tudo que
        atrai, sumindo com a dist\xE2ncia."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity Cannon now shows a tether to everything it pulls,
        fading with range."
