    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A assist\xEAncia de mira agora funciona em naves que misturam
        armas centralizadas e descentralizadas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Aim assist now works on ships mixing centered and off-center
        weapons."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os inimigos de setores avan\xE7ados agora aceleram mais r\xE1pido
        para acompanhar sua velocidade m\xE1xima."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Later-sector enemies now accelerate faster to match their
        higher top speed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A velocidade m\xE1xima no Gloss\xE1rio de inimigos agora inclui
        o ajuste de velocidade de cada inimigo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy Glossary max speed now includes each enemy's own speed
        scaling."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As fronteiras de fac\xE7\xE3o no mapa da gal\xE1xia agora absorvem
        confrontos isolados ao lado delas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Galaxy map faction borders now absorb lone faction encounters
        beside them."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro quando as reflex\xF5es da Prote\xE7\xE3o de
        Escudo destru\xEDam inimigos disparando feixes."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when Shield Ward reflections destroyed enemies
        firing beams."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os saltos de Deslocamento e Buraco Negro n\xE3o deixam mais
        naves grandes em espa\xE7os apertados."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Displacement and Black Hole jumps no longer land big ships
        inside tight gaps."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As armadilhas de Elite e o trajeto dos inimigos agora consideram
        o tamanho real do escudo de cada nave."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Elite traps and enemy pathing now allow for each ship's
        true shield size."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A visibilidade na n\xE9voa, as setas de sensor e o espa\xE7amento
        de surgimento agora usam o tamanho real da nave."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fog visibility, sensor arrows and spawn spacing now use
        true ship size."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As imagens do Motor Hologr\xE1fico agora copiam visuais lend\xE1rios,
        skins e pe\xE7as ocultas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Holo Drive images now copy legendary looks, skins and hidden
        parts."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.42
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os bocais dos propulsores cosm\xE9ticos agora somem junto com
        a nave durante a Mudan\xE7a de Fase."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Vanity thruster nozzles now vanish with the ship during
        Phase Shift."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.43
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os raios de calor do Cortex Infectado agora se alinham ao alvo
        em vez de passarem direto."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Infected Cortex heat rays now line up on the target instead
        of sweeping past."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.44
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As contagens de consum\xEDveis acima de 99 no HUD n\xE3o quebram
        mais para uma segunda linha."
      baseValue: "\u2022 HUD consumable counts above 99 no longer wrap onto a second
        line."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.45
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os Transportes de fac\xE7\xE3o e o Cortex Infectado agora s\xE3o
        desbloqueados no Gloss\xE1rio."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Faction Transports and the Infected Cortex now unlock in
        the Glossary."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.46
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A Cifra de Portal e a Pedra Angular do Setor agora s\xE3o desbloqueadas
        no Gloss\xE1rio ap\xF3s o uso."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gateway Cipher and Sector Keystone now unlock in the Glossary
        once used."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.47
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As entradas do Hist\xF3rico de Di\xE1logos agora ficam organizadas
        pelo setor onde ocorreram."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dialog History entries now file under the sector they were
        encountered in."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.48
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A sonda dos Grays agora aparece no Gloss\xE1rio assim que os
        Grays s\xE3o revelados."
      baseValue: "\u2022 The Grays probe now appears in the Glossary once the Grays
        are revealed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.49
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um cursor perdido que permanecia nas caixas de quantidade
        ap\xF3s digitar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a stray cursor lingering in amount entry boxes after
        typing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.50
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um clique no fim dos efeitos sonoros do Laser espiral."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a clicking sound at the end of Spiral Laser sound
        effects."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.51
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A m\xFAsica agora troca de faixa enquanto o jogo roda em segundo
        plano."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music now changes tracks while the game runs unfocused in
        the background."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.52
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A m\xFAsica agora s\xF3 troca de faixa quando o combate se acalma,
        corrigindo pulsos na frota."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music now changes tracks only when combat settles, fixing
        pulses at the fleet."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.53
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os sons de armas iniciados durante o Motor temporal agora desaceleram
        e voltam ao normal corretamente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Weapon sounds started during Temporal Drive now slow and
        restore correctly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.54
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As pe\xE7as de nave atingidas fora da tela n\xE3o perdem mais
        a textura nem ficam brancas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship parts hit off-screen no longer lose their texture and
        turn white."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.55
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O \xEDcone de exaustores agora mostra a sua altern\xE2ncia,
        e n\xE3o os exaustores abertos pelo disparo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 The vent icon now shows your vent toggle, not vents forced
        open by firing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.56
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os propulsores cosm\xE9ticos agora adotam os visuais de hiperpropuls\xE3o,
        Deslocamento e Motor Hologr\xE1fico."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Vanity thrusters now take on hyperdrive, displacement and
        Holo Drive looks."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.57
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os confrontos agora t\xEAm no m\xE1ximo um cache, em vez de
        \xE0s vezes acumular dois."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Encounters now hold at most one cache instead of sometimes
        stacking two."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.58
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os caches lend\xE1rios agora sempre soltam um lend\xE1rio em
        vez de um terceiro item raro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Legendary caches now always drop a legendary instead of
        a third rare item."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.59
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigidos os transportes Species-XI que n\xE3o fugiam em confrontos
        de intercepta\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed Species-XI transports not fleeing during intercept
        encounters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.60
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A hiperpropuls\xE3o agora leva o tempo de carga completo enquanto
        um Broodnest estiver vivo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hyperdrive now takes the full charge time while a Broodnest
        is still alive."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
