    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O tamanho da nave agora multiplica a amea\xE7a gerada, at\xE9
        x10 para Coura\xE7ados."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship size now multiplies threat generated, up to x10 for
        Dreadnoughts."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A Aura de Reparo agora tamb\xE9m repara seus pr\xF3prios drones
        e torres."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Repair Halo now also repairs your own drones and turrets."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O Raio de Reparo agora pode reparar seus pr\xF3prios drones
        e torres ao mirar neles."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Repair Ray can now repair your own drones and turrets when
        aimed at them."
