    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A nova op\xE7\xE3o de \xE1udio Tema da frota toca o tema principal
        enquanto a frota est\xE1 presente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Fleet Theme audio setting plays main theme while the
        fleet is present."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A dist\xE2ncia padr\xE3o da c\xE2mera agora busca um tamanho
        de nave consistente em qualquer tela."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Default camera distance now targets a consistent ship size
        on any screen."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os \xEDcones de cache agora aparecem em confrontos revelados
        para voc\xEA se planejar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cache icons now show on revealed encounters so you can plan
        ahead."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.19
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O painel de navega\xE7\xE3o agora mostra o que o cache de um
        confronto vai soltar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Navigation panel now previews what an encounter's cache
        will drop."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As p\xE1ginas de itens do Gloss\xE1rio agora mostram qual fac\xE7\xE3o
        guarda um cache fixo do item."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glossary item pages now list which faction holds a fixed
        cache for the item."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As estat\xEDsticas de classe no designer de naves agora mostram
        os novos multiplicadores de amea\xE7a."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Class stats in the ship designer now show the new threat
        multipliers."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As pastas de predefini\xE7\xF5es do designer de naves agora
        s\xE3o ordenadas alfabeticamente no seu idioma."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship designer preset folders now sort alphabetically in
        your language."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
