    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.24
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Corre\xE7\xF5es de Bugs</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.25
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido o toque r\xE1pido em armas de feixe causando muito
        mais dano do que segurar o disparo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed rapidly tapping beam weapons dealing far more damage
        than holding fire."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.26
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Feixes inimigos, chamas de Tocha e discos girat\xF3rios n\xE3o
        s\xE3o mais desenhados sob sua nave."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy beams, torch flames and spinner discs no longer render
        under your ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As auras das armas Aura agora brilham atr\xE1s das naves, em
        vez de serem desenhadas sobre inimigos pr\xF3ximos."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Halo auras now glow behind ships instead of drawing over
        nearby enemies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os rastros de Mudan\xE7a de Fase n\xE3o ficam mais para sempre
        quando uma nave morre no meio da mudan\xE7a."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Phase Shift trails no longer linger forever when a ship
        dies mid-phase."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.29
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os an\xE9is de aviso de disparo retardado n\xE3o ficam mais
        na tela ap\xF3s um reequipamento no meio do tiro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Delayed-fire warning rings no longer stick around after
        a mid-shot refit."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.30
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os contornos das naves aliadas agora s\xE3o renderizados em
        resolu\xE7\xE3o total, corrigindo as bordas pixeladas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Friendly ship outlines now render at full resolution to
        fix pixelated edges."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.31
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro quando um buraco negro se formava depois que
        a nave que o disparou era destru\xEDda."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a black hole formed after its firing
        ship was destroyed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.32
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro ao usar uma c\xE1psula no momento em que um
        esquadr\xE3o ou nave aliada morria."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error using a capsule the moment a squadron or
        friendly ship died."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigidos os contornos escuros que apareciam em Pedras Angulares
        do Setor ainda n\xE3o colocadas em um portal."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed dark outlines showing for Sector Keystones not yet
        placed in a gateway."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As naves que entram no confronto n\xE3o apontam mais as armas
        para o lado errado por um segundo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ships jumping in no longer point their weapons the wrong
        way for a second."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Soltar um equipamento sobre um item do estoque de um comerciante
        n\xE3o causa mais erro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dropping equipment onto a trader's stock item no longer
        causes an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os visuais dos efeitos de status n\xE3o ficam mais gigantes
        ou achatados depois que as naves saltam para fora."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Status effect visuals no longer become giant or squashed
        after ships jump out."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os efeitos de status n\xE3o aparecem mais flutuando sobre uma
        nave oculta ou em mudan\xE7a de fase."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Status effects no longer appear floating over a phased or
        hidden ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As chamas de Queimando agora somem naturalmente, em vez de serem
        cortadas de repente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Burning flames now fade out naturally instead of being cut
        off abruptly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As pe\xE7as arrancadas n\xE3o mostram mais contornos de debuff
        falhos que sobrevivem a elas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Blown-off parts no longer show glitchy debuff outlines that
        outlive them."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As estruturas da Chave da Singularidade e os portais desbloqueados
        n\xE3o perdem mais sua sombra."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Singularity Key structures and unlocked gateways no longer
        lose their shadow."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os efeitos das armas de chama, criog\xEAnicas e de plasma n\xE3o
        desbotam mais para cores escuras e sujas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flame, cryo and plasma weapon effects no longer fade to
        murky dark colors."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.42
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O mapa do radar agora mostra os confrontos revelados ao voc\xEA
        concluir o atual."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar map now shows encounters revealed when you complete
        your current one."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.43
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naves invocadas e de escolta agora miram junto com seu l\xEDder
        ao voar em forma\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Summoned and escort ships now aim with their leader when
        flying in formation."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.44
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigidos erros de fragatas liberando fuma\xE7a em confrontos
        em nebulosa."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed errors from frigates venting smoke in nebula encounters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.45
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido o HUD ficando oculto ap\xF3s dispensar mensagens de
        erro em sequ\xEAncia."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed the HUD staying hidden after dismissing back-to-back
        error messages."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.46
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naves destru\xEDdas no meio do ataque n\xE3o disparam mais um
        tiro final nem causam erro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ships destroyed mid-attack no longer fire a final shot or
        trigger an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.47
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigido um erro quando o dano refletido destru\xEDa uma nave
        disparando armas de feixe."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when reflected damage destroyed a ship firing
        beam weapons."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.48
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Armas do tipo lan\xE7a-chamas variam o tom do som para que c\xF3pias
        empilhadas n\xE3o soem met\xE1licas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flamethrower-style weapons vary sound pitch so stacked copies
        aren't metallic."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.49
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Armas de disparo cont\xEDnuo agora ficam em sil\xEAncio enquanto
        superaquecidas, j\xE1 que nada est\xE1 disparando."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Constant-fire weapons now go silent while overheated since
        nothing is firing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.50
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os portais para confrontos com chefes j\xE1 conclu\xEDdos n\xE3o
        mostram mais o aviso Sem Fuga."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gateways to completed boss encounters no longer show the
        No Escape warning."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.51
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corrigida a passagem da nave na tela de carregamento sumindo
        quando o jogo engasga."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed the loading screen ship flyby vanishing when the game
        stutters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.52
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os destaques de territ\xF3rio das fac\xE7\xF5es n\xE3o saem
        mais do lugar entre as visualiza\xE7\xF5es do mapa."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Faction territory highlights no longer drift out of place
        between map views."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.53
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os Propulsores Cosm\xE9ticos n\xE3o aparecem mais como slots
        equip\xE1veis nos pain\xE9is de equipamento."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Vanity thrusters no longer appear as equippable slots on
        equipment panels."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.54
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os caches destru\xEDdos n\xE3o mant\xEAm mais seus \xEDcones
        nos mapas do radar e da Navega\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Destroyed caches no longer keep their icons on the radar
        and Navigation maps."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.55
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As imagens do Motor Hologr\xE1fico agora copiam o tipo de dano
        do seu escudo, em vez de um aleat\xF3rio."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Holo Drive images now copy your shield's damage type instead
        of a random one."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.56
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A m\xFAsica do Broodnest n\xE3o toca mais em um confronto quando
        o Broodnest n\xE3o est\xE1 mais l\xE1."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Broodnest music no longer plays in an encounter after the
        Broodnest is gone."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.57
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Esquivar n\xE3o interrompe mais Efeito tempor\xE1rio / Balizas
        / Motor Hologr\xE1fico."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dodging no longer interrupts Temporary Effect / Beacons
