    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A Prote\xE7\xE3o de Escudo agora bloqueia na borda da bolha
        mesmo se usada com os escudos ca\xEDdos."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Shield Ward now blocks at the bubble edge even when used
        with shields down."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Debuffs n\xE3o atravessam mais uma Prote\xE7\xE3o de Escudo
        ativa."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Debuffs no longer pierce an active Shield Ward."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A sombra e os contornos de status das naves n\xE3o revelam mais
        naves ocultas por Mudan\xE7a de Fase."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship shadow and status outlines no longer reveal ships hidden
        by Phase Shift."
      context: 
