    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Itens no n\xEDvel m\xE1ximo podem Recalcular estat\xEDsticas
        de gra\xE7a para aplicar o balanceamento."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Level-capped items can Recalculate Stats for free to apply
        balance updates."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O gelo do Fabricante de Gelo agora parece vidro tingido em vez
        de gelo p\xE1lido e chapado."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ice Fabricator ice now looks like tinted glass instead of
        pale, flat ice."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Chamas, feixes, explos\xF5es e motores agora projetam luz sobre
        os objetos pr\xF3ximos."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flames, beams, explosions and engines now cast light onto
        nearby objects."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O novo controle deslizante gr\xE1fico Brilho din\xE2mico ajusta
        o vazamento de luz; use 0 para desativar."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Dynamic Glow graphics slider adjusts light spill; set
        to 0 to disable."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os propulsores mostram uma silhueta ao posicionar slots, pois
        ficam ocultos sob o casco."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Thrusters show a silhouette while placing slots as they
        hide under the hull."
