    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.16
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Desempenho</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Performance</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A f\xEDsica agora recupera no m\xE1ximo 3 passos por quadro
        para evitar travadas em batalhas pesadas."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Physics now catches up at most 3 steps per frame to stop
        heavy-battle stutter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As consultas de estat\xEDsticas da nave n\xE3o revasculham mais
        todo o equipamento, acelerando builds grandes."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship stat lookups no longer rescan all equipment, speeding
        up big loadouts."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.19
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 O dano de Queimando, Radioativo e Empalado agora tica em lotes
        para reduzir a carga da CPU."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Burning, Radioactive and Impaled damage ticks in batches
        to cut CPU load."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As armas autom\xE1ticas reutilizam por um instante sua checagem
        de linha de tiro em vez de refaz\xEA-la sempre."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Auto-weapons reuse their line-of-fire check briefly instead
        of every tick."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As barras de vida e os \xEDcones de status das naves s\xE3o
        reutilizados em vez de recriados a cada vez."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship health bars and status icons are reused instead of
        rebuilt each time."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As sementes de Roubo agora t\xEAm limite de 30 em voo por nave;
        o roubo extra cura na hora."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Leech seeds now cap at 30 in flight per ship; extra leech
        heals instantly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.23
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os po\xE7os gravitacionais procuram alvos com menos frequ\xEAncia,
        mas continuam puxando a cada tick."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity wells scan for targets less often while still pulling
        every tick."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.24
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Po\xE7os gravitacionais sobrepostos agora se fundem em um \xFAnico
        po\xE7o com dano acumulado."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Overlapping gravity wells now merge into a single well with
        stacked damage."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.25
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A captura de brilho ignora cascos de nave, asteroides e cont\xEAineres,
        reduzindo as chamadas de desenho pela metade."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glow capture skips ship hulls, asteroids and containers,
        halving draw calls."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.26
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 A renderiza\xE7\xE3o do contorno das naves reutiliza o estado
        gr\xE1fico em vez de redefini-lo por pe\xE7a."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship outline rendering reuses graphics state instead of
        resetting per part."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Todas as armas autom\xE1ticas de uma nave compartilham uma \xFAnica
        busca de alvo em vez de uma cada."
      baseValue: "\u2022 All auto-weapons on a ship share one target search instead
        of one each."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 As checagens de escudo dos feixes e a manuten\xE7\xE3o da lista
        de naves n\xE3o alocam mais mem\xF3ria a cada tick."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Beam shield checks and ship list upkeep no longer allocate
        memory each tick."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.29
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
