    - key: roadmap.0
      type: 9
      value: Melhorias visuais
      baseValue: Visual Improvements
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.1.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Efeitos de proj\xE9teis"
      baseValue: Projectile Effects
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.1.description
      type: 9
      value: "Aprimore os efeitos visuais de part\xEDculas e impactos para que as
        armas sejam mais satisfat\xF3rias de usar."
      baseValue: Improve the visual effects of particles and hit effects so weapons
        are more satisfying to use.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.2
      type: 9
      value: Diversidade de builds
      baseValue: Build Diversity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.3.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Quebra-limites
      baseValue: Limit Breaker
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.3.description
      type: 9
      value: "Remove o limite de 4 slots por tipo, permitindo que os designs de naves
        tenham qualquer n\xFAmero de slots prim\xE1rios, secund\xE1rios, especiais
        ou especiais autom\xE1ticos."
      baseValue: Remove the 4 slot limit on slot types allowing ship designs to have
        any number of primary, secondary, special or auto special slots.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.4.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Revis\xE3o de aprimoramentos"
      baseValue: Upgrade Overhaul
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.4.description
      type: 9
      value: "Reformule a \xE1rvore de aprimoramentos para permitir diferentes estilos
        de jogo e mais liberdade. Adicionando suporte para builds mais resistentes
        e naves mais r\xE1pidas."
      baseValue: Rework the upgrade tree to allow for different play styles and more
        freedom. Adding support for tankier builds and faster ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.5.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Classes Secund\xE1rias"
      baseValue: Secondary Classes
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.5.description
      type: 9
      value: "Adiciona uma ampla variedade de classes secund\xE1rias, cada uma constru\xEDda
        em torno de estilos de jogo distintos com fortes especializa\xE7\xF5es em
        tipos de dano."
      baseValue: Add a wide range of secondary classes, each built around distinct
        playstyles with strong damage type specialisations.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.6.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Combate Corpo a Corpo
      baseValue: Close Combat
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.6.description
      type: 9
      value: "Adiciona uma nova classe secund\xE1ria de combate corpo a corpo, junto
        com armas de foice e halo (aura)."
      baseValue: Add a new close combat secondary class along with scythe and halo
        (aura) weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.7
      type: 9
      value: Setor 4
      baseValue: Sector 4
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.8.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Armas Espinhais
      baseValue: Spinal Weapons
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.8.description
      type: 9
      value: "Chegando no Setor 4, essas armas fixas trocam flexibilidade por poder
        bruto. Espere lasers perfurantes massivos e proj\xE9teis superdimensionados."
      baseValue: Arriving in Sector 4, these fixed weapons trade flexibility for
        raw power. Expect massive piercing lasers and oversized projectiles.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Setor 4 - Fase 1
      baseValue: Sector 4 - Phase 1
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.description
      type: 9
      value: "Volte para casa, no Setor 4 (N\xEDvel 45 - 50), e defenda a Terra contra
        incurs\xF5es cada vez maiores de Species-XI e Skeran enquanto Echo conclui
        a primeira etapa de sua arma."
      baseValue: Return home to Sector 4 (Level 45 - 50) and defend Earth against
        escalating Species-XI and Skeran incursions while Echo completes the first
        stage of her weapon.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.10.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Setor 4 - Fase 2
      baseValue: Sector 4 - Phase 2
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.10.description
      type: 9
      value: "Continue a luta no Setor 4 (N\xEDvel 50 - 55) enquanto for\xE7as Phantom
        se juntam ao ataque e Echo conclui a segunda etapa de sua arma."
      baseValue: Continue the fight in Sector 4 (Level 50 - 55) as Phantoms forces
