  - categoryName: Scene.Main.Extras Canvas
    entries:
    - key: 0cm8nhhq
      type: 16
      value: "Obrigado por adquirir Star Vortex. Desenvolvo o jogo como desenvolvedor
        solo no meu tempo livre, e seu apoio significa muito.\r\n\r\n<b>O que ainda
        est\xE1 faltando?</b>\r\n<color=#89bcde>\r\n\u2022 Setor 4, a conclus\xE3o
        da hist\xF3ria principal.\r\n\u2022 A fase final do jogo, onde voc\xEA entra
        no Vazio.\r\n\u2022 Confrontos de Cerco, onde voc\xEA enfrenta esta\xE7\xF5es
        espaciais.\r\n\u2022 Muitas armas lend\xE1rias e variantes.\r</color>\r\n\r\nAs
        atualiza\xE7\xF5es chegam a cada poucas semanas com novo conte\xFAdo e melhorias.
        Tem feedback, sugest\xF5es ou relatos de bugs? Deixe tudo no canal #feedback
        do nosso Discord!\r\n\r\nObrigado mais uma vez, aproveite o jogo!"
      baseValue: "Thanks for picking up Star Vortex. I'm developing the game as a
        solo developer in my spare time, and your support means a lot.\r\n\r\n<b>What's
        currently missing?</b>\r\n<color=#89bcde>\r\n\u2022 Sector 4, conclusion
        of the main story.\r\n\u2022 Final end-game where you enter the void.\r\n\u2022
        Siege Encounters where you fight space stations.\r\n\u2022 Lots of legendary
        weapons and variants.\r</color>\r\n\r\nUpdates land every few weeks with
        new content and improvements. Got feedback, suggestions, or bug reports?
        Drop them in the #feedback channel on our Discord!\r\n\r\nThanks again, enjoy
        the game!"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: kZVs20Ft
      type: 9
      value: Ver roteiro de acesso antecipado
      baseValue: View Early Access Roadmap
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: MW1ZaFJf
      type: 16
      value: "Bem-vindo \xE0 vers\xE3o demo de Star Vortex. Se voc\xEA tiver algum
        feedback, sugest\xE3o ou relato de bug, junte-se a n\xF3s no Discord e me
        avise.\n\nEsta demo inclui todo o conte\xFAdo do jogo at\xE9 o final do primeiro
        Setor, que corresponde aproximadamente ao n\xEDvel 20. O jogo completo possui
        setores adicionais, armas, ra\xE7as, pe\xE7as de naves e muito mais.\n\nStar
        Vortex \xE9 desenvolvido por mim, <b>um desenvolvedor solo</b>, no meu tempo
        livre. Obrigado por jogar!"
      baseValue: 'Welcome to demo version of Star Vortex. If you have any feedback,
        suggestions or bug reports please join us on Discord and let me know.


        This
        demo includes all the content of the game up until the end of the first Sector
        which is around about level 20. The full game has additional sectors, weapons,
        races, ship parts and much more.


        Star Vortex is made by myself
        <b>a solo-developer</b> in my free time. Thanks for playing!'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: dOyphhuL
      type: 9
      value: Veja o roteiro de acesso antecipado
      baseValue: View Early Access Roadmap
