    - key: 2DlEjPyA
      type: 9
      value: "Cr\xE9ditos e Atribui\xE7\xE3o"
      baseValue: Credits and Attribution
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: drpH9oBF
      type: 9
      value: "Privacidade e An\xE1lise"
      baseValue: Privacy and Analytics
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jE1FAU9n
      type: 8
      value: "Para melhorar nosso jogo, gostar\xEDamos de coletar estat\xEDsticas
        e dados an\xF4nimos sobre suas sess\xF5es de jogo, progresso, erros e desempenho.\n\nIsso
        envolve o uso de um servi\xE7o de terceiros chamado \u201CUnity Analytics\u201D.
        Todos os dados s\xE3o enviados anonimamente e n\xE3o podem ser rastreados
        at\xE9 voc\xEA.\n\nNossa pol\xEDtica de privacidade pode ser encontrada em:
        <color=#89bcde>https://huntedcow.com/privacy-policy/</color>\n\nVoc\xEA pode
        ativar ou desativar isso a qualquer momento na aba Configura\xE7\xF5es avan\xE7adas."
      baseValue: 'To improve our game, we would like to collect anonymized statistics
        and data about your play sessions, progress, crashes and performance.


        This
        involves using a third-party service called "Unity Analytics". All data is
        sent anonymously and cannot be traced back to you.


        Our privacy
        policy can be found at: <color=#89bcde>https://huntedcow.com/privacy-policy/</color>


        You
        can enable or disable this at any time under the Advanced Settings tab.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: AMLLy4mq
      type: 9
      value: "N\xE3o enviar"
      baseValue: Do Not Send
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: b7PYrOq6
      type: 9
      value: Enviar dados
      baseValue: Send Data
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GZLozQXD
      type: 9
      value: "Informa\xE7\xF5es da demo"
      baseValue: Demo Information
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EkEE1zgi
      type: 8
      value: "Voc\xEA est\xE1 jogando a <color=#89bcde>Demo</color> de Star Vortex.
        \n\nEmbora esta vers\xE3o seja mantida atualizada com todos os recursos mais
        recentes, <color=#89bcde>voc\xEA n\xE3o poder\xE1 prosseguir al\xE9m do final
        do Setor 1</color>. No entanto, <b>qualquer progresso que voc\xEA fizer ser\xE1
        transferido para o jogo completo</b> quando ele for lan\xE7ado.\n\nO jogo
        completo j\xE1 est\xE1 em Acesso Antecipado, ent\xE3o se voc\xEA quiser experiment\xE1-lo,
        pode!\n\n<color=#89bcde>Jogadores da Steam n\xE3o receber\xE3o nenhuma conquista
        na Steam. Elas ser\xE3o concedidas retroativamente no jogo completo!</color>"
      baseValue: "You're playing the <color=#89bcde>Demo</color> of Star Vortex.
        \n\nAlthough this version is kept up to date with all the latest features
        <color=#89bcde>you will not be able to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>.
        However, <b>any progress you make will transfer to the full game</b> when
        it is released.\n\nThe full game is out in Early Access now so if you want
        to try it out you can!\n\n<color=#89bcde>Steam players wont be awarded any
        achievements in Steam. They'll be retro-actively awarded in the full game
        though!</color>"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ALDKgoUc
      type: 9
      value: "Vers\xE3o para navegador"
      baseValue: Browser Version
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: k80TWFDG
      type: 8
      value: "Voc\xEA est\xE1 jogando a <color=#89bcde>Demo para navegador</color>
        de Star Vortex. \n\nEmbora esta vers\xE3o ofere\xE7a horas de jogo, <color=#89bcde>voc\xEA
        n\xE3o poder\xE1 prosseguir al\xE9m do final do Setor 1</color>.\n\nO jogo
        completo j\xE1 est\xE1 dispon\xEDvel em Acesso Antecipado, ent\xE3o, se voc\xEA
        quiser experiment\xE1-lo, pode encontr\xE1-lo na Steam ou na loja Epic."
      baseValue: "You're playing the <color=#89bcde>Browser Demo</color> of Star
        Vortex. \n\nAlthough there are hours of gameplay in this version <color=#89bcde>you
        will not be able to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>.\n\nThe full
        game is out in Early Access now so if you want to try it out you can find
        it on Steam or the Epic store."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SfiZVcmg
      type: 9
      value: Acesso antecipado
      baseValue: Early Access
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PmNCh8qJ
      type: 8
      value: "Obrigado por adquirir <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color>! Estou desenvolvendo
        o jogo como desenvolvedor solo no meu tempo livre e chegar at\xE9 aqui foi
        uma jornada incr\xEDvel.\n\nAtualmente, a <b>hist\xF3ria termina ap\xF3s
        o Setor 3</b>, com mais conte\xFAdo j\xE1 a caminho. Se voc\xEA encontrar
        algum bug, algo parecer estranho ou tiver alguma ideia para melhorar o jogo,
        adoraria saber. Voc\xEA pode deixar seu feedback no nosso Discord.\n\nAproveite
        o jogo, e obrigado novamente pelo apoio!"
      baseValue: 'Thanks for picking up <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color>! I''m
        developing the game as a solo developer in my spare time and getting to this
        point has been a wild ride.


        The <b>story currently ends after Sector
        3</b> with more content already in the pipeline. If you hit a bug, something
        feels off, or you''ve got an idea to improve the game, I''d love to hear
        it. You can drop your feedback in our Discord.


        Enjoy the game,
        and thanks again for the support!'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
