  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Demo End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: kavk7l86
      type: 9
      value: "Demo conclu\xEDda"
      baseValue: Demo Complete
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Sp3qc7xG
      type: 8
      value: "Parab\xE9ns, voc\xEA concluiu a demo!\n\n<color=#89bcde>O jogo completo
        j\xE1 est\xE1 dispon\xEDvel em Acesso Antecipado! Quer voc\xEA o adquira
        ou n\xE3o, adoraria saber o que voc\xEA achou da demo no nosso Discord.</color>\n\n<color=#5776a0>Os
        saves dos jogadores ser\xE3o transferidos para o jogo completo para que sua
        aventura possa continuar.</color>"
      baseValue: 'Congrats, you have completed the demo!


        <color=#89bcde>The
        full game is now out in Early Access! Whether you grab it or not, I''d love
        to hear what you thought of the demo in our Discord.</color>


        <color=#5776a0>Player
        saves will transfer to the full game so your adventure can continue.</color>'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 5dynyIZW
      type: 9
      value: "Ver p\xE1gina da loja"
      baseValue: View Store Page
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Early Access End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: sd1yGGyy
      type: 9
      value: "Acesso antecipado: hist\xF3ria em desenvolvimento"
      baseValue: 'Early Access: Story In Progress'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: M2TRKJpM
      type: 8
      value: "A progress\xE3o da hist\xF3ria est\xE1 pausada... por enquanto.\n\nVoc\xEA
        chegou ao limite atual de conte\xFAdo da hist\xF3ria no Acesso Antecipado.
        Mais hist\xF3ria e sistemas est\xE3o em desenvolvimento.\n\nVoc\xEA pode
        continuar jogando no <color=#FB6330>New Game+</color>, reiniciando as miss\xF5es
        e voltando ao Setor 1 em um n\xEDvel mais alto, mantendo sua nave, aprimoramentos
        e itens."
      baseValue: 'Story progression paused... for now.


        You''ve reached
        the current limit of story content in Early Access. More story and systems
        are in development.


        You can continue playing in <color=#FB6330>New
        Game+</color>, resetting missions and returning to Sector 1 at a higher level
        while keeping your ship, upgrades, and items.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: WBmB4joN
      type: 8
      value: "O New Game+ \xE9 opcional. Uma vez iniciada, esta escolha \xE9 permanente
        e voc\xEA n\xE3o poder\xE1 retornar a este n\xEDvel."
      baseValue: New Game+ is optional. Once started, this choice is permanent and
        you cannot return to this level.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vRuztZBk
      type: 9
      value: Iniciar New Game+
      baseValue: Start New Game+
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
