  - categoryName: Scene.Game.HUD Events
    entries:
    - key: PfOlqnn5
      type: 10
      value: "Salto de hiperpropuls\xE3o em:"
      baseValue: 'Hyperdrive Jump In:'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: Scene.Game.HUD Tutorial Helper
    entries:
    - key: OG7Lffb1
      type: 18
      value: "Voc\xEA pode usar seu raio trator para puxar cont\xEAineres de itens
        pr\xF3ximos."
      baseValue: You can use your tractor beam to pull in nearby item containers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D4tpv9Eg
      type: 18
      value: "Voc\xEA pode girar, acelerar e estabilizar sua nave usando os controles
        abaixo."
      baseValue: You can turn, accelerate and stabilize your ship using the controls
        below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GgnYo5Si
      type: 18
      value: "Segure a tecla de esquiva e pressione qualquer dire\xE7\xE3o para desviar
        e evitar inimigos."
      baseValue: Hold the dodge key and press any direction to dodge and avoid enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8ksGCocz
      type: 18
      value: "Mantenha pressionado o modificador de esquiva e mova-se na dire\xE7\xE3o
        para esquivar dessa maneira."
      baseValue: Hold down the dodge modifier and move in a direction to dodge that
        way.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 40aaJoXo
      type: 18
      value: "Use o bot\xE3o de impulso se precisar chegar a algum lugar rapidamente."
      baseValue: Use the boost button if you need to get somewhere quickly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A3xhd830
      type: 18
      value: "Armas prim\xE1rias geram calor quando usadas; o superaquecimento as
        desativar\xE1."
      baseValue: Primary weapons generate heat when used, overheating will disable
        them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8yy9WQ8e
      type: 18
      value: Alterne o modo torre para mirar suas armas independentemente da sua
        nave.
      baseValue: Toggle turret mode to aim your weapons independently from your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qjFmgpCP
      type: 18
      value: "Voc\xEA pode mirar separadamente da sua nave usando os controles abaixo."
      baseValue: You can aim separately from your ship using the controls below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YOcC3mqm
      type: 18
      value: "O painel principal cont\xE9m aprimoramentos, equipamentos, miss\xF5es
        e navega\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: The core panel contains upgrades, equipment, missions and navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D8bNqsfe
      type: 18
      value: "Atire em um dos asteroides pr\xF3ximos para praticar tiro."
      baseValue: Shoot one of the nearby asteroids for target practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: mtEKYWW3
      type: 18
      value: "Voc\xEA completou uma miss\xE3o. Ela pode ser coletada no <color=#ffc600>Painel
        de Miss\xE3o</color>."
      baseValue: You have completed a mission. It can be collected from the <color=#ffc600>Mission
        Panel</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jXjkzH27
      type: 18
      value: "Mova-se em dire\xE7\xE3o \xE0 nave-m\xE3e e pressione <color=#ffc600>interagir</color>
        para atracar."
      baseValue: Move toward the mothership and press <color=#ffc600>interact</color>
        to dock.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: sfgfxbnx
      type: 18
      value: "Voc\xEA pode usar a hiperpropuls\xE3o para saltar entre confrontos
        e viajar mais r\xE1pido."
      baseValue: You can hyperdrive jump between encounters for faster travel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Xg6o3rEX
      type: 18
      value: Coloque a <color=#ffc600>Pedra Angular do Setor</color> no Portal do
        Setor em <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      baseValue: Place the <color=#ffc600>Sector Keystone</color> into the Secor
        Gateway at <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xwPjwzi8
      type: 18
      value: "<color=#ffc600>Resist\xEAncia de escudo</color> tornar\xE1 voc\xEA
        imune a debuffs desse tipo."
      baseValue: <color=#ffc600>Shield Resistance</color> will make you immune to
        debuffs of that type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: r6IBC7w9
      type: 18
      value: "Agora voc\xEA pode desbloquear um slot adicional no painel <color=#ffc600>Aprimoramentos</color>."
      baseValue: You can now unlock an additional slot in the <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color>
        panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hPHo23Bg
      type: 18
      value: "Classes adicionais de naves est\xE3o dispon\xEDveis em <color=#ffc600>Design
        de naves</color> na <color=#ffc600>Nave-m\xE3e</color>."
      baseValue: Additional ship classes are available in <color=#ffc600>Ship Design</color>
        at the <color=#ffc600>Mothership</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ArqiBaTi
      type: 18
      value: "Voc\xEA pode vincular slots de <color=#DB5656>arma secund\xE1ria</color>
        e <color=#7756DB>especial</color> no painel de equipamentos."
      baseValue: You can link <color=#DB5656>Secondary Weapon</color> and <color=#7756DB>Special</color>
        slots in the equipment panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hmkSTF8r
      type: 18
      value: "Acelerar em alta velocidade torna voc\xEA <color=#DA5F00>invulner\xE1vel</color>
        e desativa as armas."
      baseValue: Boosting at high speed makes you <color=#DA5F00>invulnerable</color>
        and disables weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vAJLXeSx
      type: 18
      value: "Abra o <color=#ffc600>painel de navega\xE7\xE3o</color> para localizar
        o Montador no mapa do setor."
      baseValue: Open the <color=#ffc600>Navigation Panel</color> to locate the Assembler
        on the sector map.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Yl7Tc7Bv
      type: 18
      value: "Os pontos de refer\xEAncia s\xE3o <color=#ffc600>desbloqueios permanentes</color>
        e ainda podem ser acessados ap\xF3s a regenera\xE7\xE3o do setor."
      baseValue: Waypoints are <color=#ffc600>permanent unlocks</color> and can still
        be jumped to after the sector is regenerated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: FFlVzdh8
      type: 18
      value: "Use a <color=#ff441b>Semente infectada</color> em um <color=#ffc600>ponto
        de refer\xEAncia</color> se quiser enfrentar mais inimigos da Esp\xE9cie-XI."
      baseValue: Use the <color=#ff441b>Infected Seed</color> on a <color=#ffc600>Waypoint</color>
        if you want to fight more Species-XI enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
