    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsHeading
      type: 9
      value: "Rea\xE7\xF5es"
      baseValue: Reactions
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsIntro
      type: 9
      value: "Quando um inimigo carrega dois desses debuffs ao mesmo tempo, uma rea\xE7\xE3o
        \xE9 disparada. Ambos os debuffs permanecem aplicados, mas nenhuma nova rea\xE7\xE3o
        pode ser disparada nesse inimigo por 1 segundo. O diagrama mostra quais pares
        acionam qual rea\xE7\xE3o. Tanto o dano quanto a chance de debuff dos acertos
        de uma rea\xE7\xE3o v\xEAm da arma que aplicou o debuff que a disparou, ent\xE3o
        rea\xE7\xF5es podem encadear em mais rea\xE7\xF5es."
      baseValue: When an enemy carries two of these debuffs at the same time, a reaction
        fires. Both debuffs stay applied, but no reaction can trigger on that enemy
        again for 1 second. The diagram shows which pairs trigger which reaction.
        Both the damage and the debuff chance on a reaction's hits come from the
        weapon that applied the triggering debuff, so reactions can chain into more
        reactions.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
