    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinSteamOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Jogadores da Steam ainda podem entrar pela Steam, mas o assistente
        de conex\xE3o do star-vortex.com n\xE3o respondeu, ent\xE3o ningu\xE9m mais
        pode entrar."
      baseValue: Steam players can still join through Steam, but the star-vortex.com
        connection helper did not answer, so nobody else can join.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinHelperOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Jogadores da lista de jogos ainda podem entrar pelo assistente de conex\xE3o
        do star-vortex.com (funciona com a maioria dos roteadores), mas ningu\xE9m
        pode entrar por endere\xE7o IP."
      baseValue: Players from the game list can still join through the star-vortex.com
        connection helper (works with most routers), but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinFriendsHelperOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Seus amigos da Steam ainda podem entrar pelo assistente de conex\xE3o
        do star-vortex.com (funciona com a maioria dos roteadores), mas ningu\xE9m
        pode entrar por endere\xE7o IP."
      baseValue: Your Steam friends can still join through the star-vortex.com connection
        helper (works with most routers), but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinNone
      type: 10
      value: "O assistente de conex\xE3o do star-vortex.com tamb\xE9m n\xE3o respondeu,
        ent\xE3o seu jogo n\xE3o p\xF4de ser listado e ningu\xE9m pode entrar. Encaminhe
        manualmente a porta UDP {0} para resolver isso."
      baseValue: The star-vortex.com connection helper did not answer either, so
        your game could not be listed and nobody can join. Forward UDP port {0} manually
        to fix this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinFriendsNone
      type: 10
      value: "O assistente de conex\xE3o do star-vortex.com tamb\xE9m n\xE3o respondeu,
        ent\xE3o seus amigos da Steam n\xE3o conseguem ver seu jogo e ningu\xE9m
        pode entrar. Encaminhe manualmente a porta UDP {0} para resolver isso."
      baseValue: The star-vortex.com connection helper did not answer either, so
        your Steam friends cannot see your game and nobody can join. Forward UDP
        port {0} manually to fix this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
