  - categoryName: WorldController
    entries:
    - key: worldController.introDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Mantenham a linha! Mantenham essas coisas longe da nave-m\xE3e!"
      baseValue: Hold the line! Keep those things off the mothership!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Mais hostis se aproximando. No momento, est\xE3o em vantagem num\xE9rica
        de cinco para um."
      baseValue: More hostiles approaching. They currently outnumber us five to one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Isso n\xE3o parece bom..."
      baseValue: This isn't looking good...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Sinal an\xF4malo detectado. \xC9... um transponder vindo de uma embarca\xE7\xE3o
        abandonada. A dist\xE2ncia \xE9... este alcance n\xE3o deveria ser poss\xEDvel."
      baseValue: Anomalous signal detected. It's... a transponder coming from a derelict
        vessel. Its distance is... this range shouldn't be possible.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.5
      type: 2
      value: "Um naufr\xE1gio? Tem certeza?"
      baseValue: A shipwreck? Are you sure?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.6
      type: 2
      value: "Positivo. A intensidade do sinal sugere que \xE9 real. Mas n\xE3o dever\xEDamos
        ser capazes de detect\xE1-lo a esta dist\xE2ncia."
      baseValue: Positive. Signal strength suggests it's real. But we shouldn't be
        able to detect it at this range.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.7
      type: 2
      value: "A dist\xE2ncia \xE9 boa! Defina o curso imediatamente. Seguiremos sua
        lideran\xE7a."
      baseValue: Distance is good! Set course immediately. We'll follow your lead.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelNavigationDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Precisamos percorrer este setor para encontrar as pedras angulares do
        setor.
      baseValue: We need to work our way through this sector to find the Sector Keystones.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelNavigationDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "A nave pode fazer hipersaltos entre confrontos conectados enquanto
        voc\xEA explora."
      baseValue: The ship can hyperjump between connected encounters as you explore.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bem-vindo ao sistema de aprimoramentos. Tente n\xE3o quebrar nada."
      baseValue: Welcome to the upgrade system. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Suba de n\xEDvel para ganhar pontos de aprimoramento. A cada 10 n\xEDveis,
        voc\xEA ganha um novo slot de arma."
      baseValue: Level up to earn upgrade points. Every 10 levels, you get a shiny
        new weapon slot.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Naves maiores come\xE7am a ser desbloqueadas no n\xEDvel 15... se voc\xEA
        sobreviver at\xE9 l\xE1."
      baseValue: Bigger ships start to unlock at 15... assuming you survive that
        long.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nenhuma escolha \xE9 permanente. Voc\xEA pode redefinir tudo de gra\xE7a."
      baseValue: No choices are permanent. You can reset it all for free.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelSlotUnlockedDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Novo slot de arma desbloqueado. Tente n\xE3o desperdi\xE7\xE1-lo."
      baseValue: New weapon slot unlocked. Try not to waste it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelSlotUnlockedDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA precisar\xE1 atracar na nave-m\xE3e para atualizar o design
        da sua nave. Vou me abster de julg\xE1-lo... em voz alta."
      baseValue: You'll need to dock with the mothership to update your ship design.
        I'll refrain from judging it... loudly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelIncreaseLevelDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Use seus cr\xE9ditos aqui para aumentar o n\xEDvel de um item. Os atributos
        melhoram, ent\xE3o seu equipamento antigo n\xE3o ficar\xE1 obsoleto."
      baseValue: Spend credits here to raise an item's level. Stats improve, so yer
        old gear doesn't fall behind.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelIncreaseRarityDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Aumente a raridade de um item sacrificando um item mais forte do mesmo
        tipo. Uma raridade maior significa mais espa\xE7o para modificadores, sem
        perder o que voc\xEA j\xE1 possui."
      baseValue: Boost an item's rarity by sacrificing a stronger one of the same
        kind. Higher rarity means more room for modifiers, without losing what ya've
        already got.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelReplaceModifierDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Isso permite que voc\xEA remova um modificador de um item e o coloque
        em outro. Custa cr\xE9ditos e, a menos que seja um esquema, o item doador
        fica com a sucata depois."
      baseValue: This lets ya lift a modifier off one item and stick it on another.
        Costs credits, and unless it's a schematic, the donor's scrap after.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarSkirmishDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Algumas naves inimigas est\xE3o perturbando os portais. Elimine essas
        naves para prosseguir!"
      baseValue: Some of the enemy ships are disrupting the gateways. Eliminate those
        ships to proceed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarWarzoneDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "M\xFAltiplos inimigos se aproximando da sua posi\xE7\xE3o. N\xE3o se
        preocupe, enviarei refor\xE7os para ajudar!"
      baseValue: Multiple enemies closing on your position. Don't worry, I'll send
        reinforcements to assist!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarRescueDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "O hiperpropulsor do nosso aliado est\xE1 danificado. Defenda-o at\xE9
        que ele consiga restaur\xE1-lo!"
      baseValue: Our ally's hyperdrive is damaged. Defend them until they can get
        it back online!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarInterceptDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Interceptamos um grupo de naves de transporte transportando uma carga
        valiosa. Destrua-as antes que elas escapem!
      baseValue: We've intercepted a group of transport ships carrying valuable cargo.
        Destroy them before they escape with it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarTraderDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Naves mercantes como esta n\xE3o tomam partido. N\xE3o que estejamos
        em posi\xE7\xE3o de discutir."
      baseValue: Trading vessels like this don't take sides. Not that we're in any
        position to argue.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarEliteDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Elimine os inimigos rapidamente, um inimigo de elite est\xE1 chegando."
      baseValue: Eliminate the enemies quickly, an elite foe is incoming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.increaseRarityDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Pois bem, agora voc\xEA est\xE1 subindo na gal\xE1xia! Traga seu equipamento
        e eu aprimoro sua raridade. Vamos faz\xEA-lo brilhar!"
      baseValue: Well now, yer movin' up in the galaxy! Bring me yer gear, and I'll
        upgrade it's rarity. Let's make it shine!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.replaceModifierDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Certo, aqui vai uma novidade. Agora posso transferir modificadores
        entre equipamentos. Vamos ser criativos, n\xE9?"
      baseValue: Right, here's something new. I can transfer modifiers between equipment
        now. Let's get creative, eh?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "A visibilidade est\xE1 abaixo do ideal. Ativando as sa\xEDdas de exaust\xE3o."
      baseValue: Visibility is suboptimal. Activating exhaust vents.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Muito melhor. Voc\xEA pode desativ\xE1-las novamente se quiser ocult\xE1-las."
      baseValue: Much better. You can toggle them back closed if you wish to hide.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Como um covarde?
      baseValue: Like a coward?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3ooo, como um predador, \xE0 espreita da presa! Mas n\xE3o consigo
        disparar armas nem usar o impulso sem abri-las."
      baseValue: Nooo, like a predator, stalking their prey! I can't fire weapons
        or boost without opening them though.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisMoltenAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Asteroides fundidos detectados. A colis\xE3o aplicar\xE1 Queimando,
        infligindo danos t\xE9rmicos ao longo do tempo e aumentando rapidamente o
        calor da nave. Os danos t\xE9rmicos s\xE3o amplificados nesta regi\xE3o."
      baseValue: Molten asteroids detected. Collision will apply Burning, dealing
        thermal damage over time and rapidly increasing ship heat. Thermal damage
        is amplified in this region.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisFrozenAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Campo de destro\xE7os congelados \xE0 frente. O impacto pode causar
        congelamento, reduzindo a velocidade e o poder de fogo da arma em cinquenta
        por cento, al\xE9m de dissipar o calor rapidamente. O dano por frio \xE9
        amplificado nesta \xE1rea."
      baseValue: Frozen debris field ahead. Impact may inflict Frozen, reducing speed
        and weapon output by fifty percent while draining heat quickly. Cold damage
        is enhanced in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisRadioactiveAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Presen\xE7a de asteroides radioativos. A colis\xE3o causa dano radioativo
        cumulativo que ignora escudos. Evite impactos repetidos. O dano por radia\xE7\xE3o
        \xE9 amplificado nesta \xE1rea."
      baseValue: Radioactive asteroids present. Collision applies stacking Radioactive
        damage that bypasses shields. Avoid repeated impacts. Radiation damage is
        amplified in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisCorrosiveAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Detritos corrosivos detectados. O impacto causa corros\xE3o, permitindo
        que os inimigos acertem golpes cr\xEDticos em voc\xEA. O dano corrosivo \xE9
        aumentado nesta \xE1rea."
      baseValue: Corrosive debris detected. Impact causes Corroding, allowing enemies
        to critical strike you. Corrosive damage is increased in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisInvaderNebulaDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Part\xEDculas do vazio detectadas. O contato causar\xE1 Queimando,
        infligindo danos t\xE9rmicos ao longo do tempo e aumentando o calor. N\xE3o
        voe atrav\xE9s delas desnecessariamente."
      baseValue: Void particles detected. Contact will trigger Burning, applying
        thermal damage over time and increasing heat. Do not fly through them unnecessarily.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
