      value: "J\xE1 era hora de ver um rosto amigo! Cad\xEA o velho Gid?"
      baseValue: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Novus Prime... Vou te enviar as coordenadas.
      baseValue: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "O hiperpropulsor est\xE1 dando problema... essa coisa maldita tem vida
        pr\xF3pria. Vou precisar de um tempinho. Mantenha esses hostis longe de mim,
        t\xE1?"
      baseValue: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own.
        I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: Avalon
      baseValue: Avalon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sua incurs\xE3o termina aqui. Voc\xEA est\xE1 irremediavelmente em
        desvantagem!"
      baseValue: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Eu n\xE3o teria tanta certeza disso."
      baseValue: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Todas as naves, concentrem fogo na Cidadela. Isso acaba aqui!
      baseValue: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "O casco est\xE1 prestes a ceder. Estou liberando a tripula\xE7\xE3o...
        a responsabilidade agora \xE9 sua."
      baseValue: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you
        now.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bom trabalho. Agora, v\xE1 colocar aquela pedra angular no portal do
        setor. Ainda n\xE3o terminamos!"
      baseValue: Good work. Now, go place that keystone in the sector gateway. We're
        not done yet!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.name
      type: 5
      value: Infernum
      baseValue: Infernum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Aquela \xE9 uma cobra grande..."
      baseValue: That's a big snake...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Vou poup\xE1-lo da piada \xF3bvia..."
      baseValue: I'll spare you the obvious joke...
