      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Malditos cultistas. Aposto que eles acreditam em alien\xEDgenas."
      baseValue: Damn cultists. I bet they believe in aliens.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA n\xE3o percebeu todos os alien\xEDgenas que enfrentamos?"
      baseValue: Did you miss all the aliens we've been fighting?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Esquecidas est\xE3o as mem\xF3rias do futuro!"
      baseValue: Forgotten are the memories of the future!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Tanto faz. S\xF3 n\xE3o beba o Kool-Aid deles."
      baseValue: Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.
