      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Estou detectando n\xEDveis perigosamente altos de radia\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: I'm detecting dangerously high levels of radiation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Isso n\xE3o \xE9 apenas o espa\xE7o em geral?"
      baseValue: Isn't that just space in general?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1 mais alto que o normal. Aquela nave est\xE1 vazando por todo
        lado."
      baseValue: This is higher than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xD3timo. Exatamente o que precis\xE1vamos..."
      baseValue: Great. Just what we needed...
