    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Uma nave do Conclave... inesperada. Voc\xEA veio ver como \xE9 a verdadeira
        liberdade?"
      baseValue: A Conclave ship... unexpected. Do you come to see what freedom truly
        looks like?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Eu vou aonde preciso.
      baseValue: I go where I need to.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ent\xE3o observe bem. \xC9 isso que o Conclave teme, aquilo que nunca
        conseguiu controlar."
      baseValue: Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave fears, what it
        could never control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Eu meio que gosto desses caras...
      baseValue: I kind of like these guys...
