    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA avan\xE7a em dire\xE7\xE3o ao Prisma como todos os conquistadores
        antes de voc\xEA... cego para o que voc\xEA n\xE3o entende."
      baseValue: You charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind
        to what you do not understand.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Desculpas pela demora...
      baseValue: Apologies for the delay...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Mais uma vez rumo \xE0 brecha, todas as naves ao ataque!"
      baseValue: Once more unto the breach, all ships engage!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o vamos aguentar por muito mais tempo. Estou recuando. N\xE3o
        deixe que isso seja em v\xE3o."
      baseValue: We won't hold together much longer. I'm pulling back. Don't let
        this be for nothing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Mais um inimigo derrotado. Parab\xE9ns. Vamos carregar aquele portal
        de setor."
      baseValue: Another enemy vanquished. Well done. Let's get that sector gateway
        charged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Apenas mais um setor est\xE1 entre n\xF3s e a Terra."
      baseValue: Only one more sector stands between us and Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Um setor cheio de plantas...
      baseValue: A sector full of plants...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Plantas? Ah, sim, a flora... linda...
      baseValue: Plants? Oh right, the Flora... lovely...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
