    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Droga. Se eles est\xE3o atacando t\xE3o longe, significa que a Terra
        j\xE1 est\xE1 em risco. Precisamos voltar e avis\xE1-los."
      baseValue: Damn. If they're attacking this far out, it means Earth is already
        at risk. We need to get back and warn them.
      context: 
