      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Eficiente. Brutal. Eu sabia que voc\xEA n\xE3o me decepcionaria."
      baseValue: Efficient. Brutal. I knew you wouldn't disappoint.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Este componente, para come\xE7ar, nunca foi deles. Pertencia aos que
        vieram antes."
      baseValue: This component was never theirs to begin with. It belonged to the
        ones who came before.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o demore. H\xE1 mais para quebrar... e mais para construir."
      baseValue: Don't linger. There's more to break... and more to build.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
