      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "At\xE9 mesmo a Flora, t\xE3o desesperada para preservar a natureza,
        se agarrou a rel\xEDquias que mal conseguia compreender."
      baseValue: Even the Flora, so desperate to preserve nature, clung to relics
        they barely comprehended.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Outra pe\xE7a reivindicada... o design fica mais claro a cada uma delas."
      baseValue: Another piece claimed... the design grows clearer with each one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.name
      type: 5
      value: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA de novo... Para que voc\xEA est\xE1 colecionando essas pe\xE7as?"
      baseValue: You again... What are you collecting these parts for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Esta n\xE3o \xE9 tecnologia Phantom. Foi criada pelos Architect...
        aqueles que semearam a vida pelas estrelas."
      baseValue: This isn't Phantom technology. It was crafted by the Architects...
        the ones who seeded life across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Antes que perdessem seu prop\xF3sito... e desaparecessem em sua pr\xF3pria
        luz."
      baseValue: Before they lost their purpose... and vanished into their own light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Estou reivindicando isso para um prop\xF3sito maior. Quando chegar
        a hora, voc\xEA ver\xE1."
      baseValue: I'm claiming it for a higher purpose. When the time comes you will
        see.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
