      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Conclave.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "O \xFAltimo grande imp\xE9rio humano, unificado sob o Imperador ap\xF3s
        as guerras planet\xE1rias quase exterminarem a humanidade. Seu governo militarista
        valoriza a ordem, a estabilidade e a for\xE7a acima de tudo. Os cidad\xE3os
        vivem vidas pr\xF3speras, sustentados por IA avan\xE7ada e automa\xE7\xE3o,
        com servi\xE7o militar obrigat\xF3rio para todo adulto. O Conclave se v\xEA
        como o escudo da humanidade contra uma gal\xE1xia hostil."
      baseValue: "The last great human empire, unified under the Emperor after the
        planetary wars nearly wiped humanity out. Its militaristic government values
        order, stability, and strength above all else. Citizens live prosperous lives
        supported by advanced AI and automation, with mandatory military service
        for every adult. The Conclave sees itself as humanity\u2019s shield against
        a hostile galaxy."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Skeran.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Uma ra\xE7a brutal movida pela conquista, pela hierarquia e pela expans\xE3o
        sem fim. Suas frotas dominam os inimigos por pura agressividade e n\xFAmero
        esmagador. Os Skeran foram originalmente criados e manipulados pelos Phantoms
        como armas vivas. Incont\xE1veis ninhadas ainda permanecem ocultas al\xE9m
        do espa\xE7o explorado."
      baseValue: A brutal race driven by conquest, hierarchy, and endless expansion.
        Their fleets overwhelm enemies through sheer aggression and overwhelming
        numbers. The Skeran were originally created and manipulated by the Phantoms
        as living weapons. Countless broods still remain hidden beyond explored space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Phantom.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Uma esp\xE9cie antiga e altamente avan\xE7ada que v\xEA as civiliza\xE7\xF5es
        mais jovens como primitivas e autodestrutivas. Eles desprezam o militarismo
        do Conclave e favorecem o Pantheon por sua diplomacia. Os Phantoms s\xE3o
        reservados, manipuladores e pacientes al\xE9m da compreens\xE3o mortal. Grande
        parte do sofrimento da gal\xE1xia pode ser atribu\xEDda \xE0 sua interfer\xEAncia."
      baseValue: "An ancient and highly advanced species that views younger civilizations
        as primitive and self-destructive. They despise the Conclave\u2019s militarism
        and favor the Pantheon for its diplomacy. The Phantoms are secretive, manipulative,
        and patient beyond mortal understanding. Much of the galaxy\u2019s suffering
        can be traced back to their interference."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Flora.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Uma esp\xE9cie vegetal senciente que evoluiu de forma independente
        da vida animal dentro do Setor 3. Eles enxergam as civiliza\xE7\xF5es de
        base animal como parasitas violentos que corrompem a ordem natural. Ferozmente
        protetores de seu territ\xF3rio, os Flora respondem com agressividade a qualquer
        invas\xE3o de seus mundos. Para eles, ind\xFAstria e expans\xE3o s\xE3o doen\xE7as
        que precisam ser purgadas."
      baseValue: A sentient plant species that evolved independently from animal
        life within Sector 3. They see animal-based civilizations as violent parasites
        corrupting the natural order. Fiercely protective of their territory, the
        Flora respond aggressively to any intrusion into their worlds. To them, industry
        and expansion are diseases that must eventually be purged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Species-XI.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Entidades horr\xEDveis vindas do vazio al\xE9m dos portais. Elas se
        espalham como uma infec\xE7\xE3o, corrompendo naves, tecnologia e criaturas
        vivas. Simplesmente surgem e come\xE7am a destruir tudo em seu caminho, sem
        que nunca tenha sido observada qualquer tentativa de comunica\xE7\xE3o. Pouco
        se sabe sobre sua verdadeira natureza, pois a maioria dos confrontos termina
        em aniquila\xE7\xE3o total."
      baseValue: Horrific entities from the void beyond the gateways. They spread
        like an infection, corrupting ships, technology, and living creatures. They
        simply appear and begin destroying everything in their path, with no attempts
        at communication ever observed. Very little is understood about their true
        nature, as most encounters end in total annihilation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Grays.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Misteriosos extraterrestres obcecados por experimenta\xE7\xE3o gen\xE9tica
        e perfei\xE7\xE3o biol\xF3gica. Eles evitam a guerra aberta, recorrendo a
        abdu\xE7\xF5es, observa\xE7\xE3o e manipula\xE7\xE3o encoberta. Os encontros
        com os Grays s\xE3o raros, cl\xEDnicos e profundamente perturbadores, e as
        v\xEDtimas frequentemente desaparecem sem explica\xE7\xE3o. A maioria das
        civiliza\xE7\xF5es descarta as hist\xF3rias sobre eles como teorias da conspira\xE7\xE3o
        at\xE9 que sejam levadas elas mesmas."
      baseValue: Mysterious extraterrestrials obsessed with genetic experimentation
        and biological perfection. They avoid open warfare, instead relying on abductions,
        observation, and covert manipulation. Encounters with the Grays are rare,
        clinical, and deeply unsettling, with victims often disappearing without
        explanation. Most civilizations dismiss stories about them as conspiracy
        theories until they are taken themselves.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Neutral.backstory
      type: 8
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Forgotten.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Uma fac\xE7\xE3o dissidente de Phantoms que rejeitou o decl\xEDnio
        de sua esp\xE9cie e abra\xE7ou a domina\xE7\xE3o. Eles se consideram superiores
        a toda outra forma de vida e buscam escravizar civiliza\xE7\xF5es mais fracas.
        Os Forgotten interferem abertamente e manipulam as ra\xE7as mais jovens onde
        quer que as encontrem. Seus mundos s\xE3o repletos de tecnologia antiga distorcida
        em ferramentas de controle."
      baseValue: A rogue faction of Phantoms who rejected the decline of their species
        and embraced domination instead. They believe themselves superior to all
        other life and seek to enslave weaker civilizations. The Forgotten openly
        interfere with and manipulate younger races wherever they find them. Their
        worlds are filled with ancient technology twisted into tools of control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Shadow.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Unidades especializadas de infiltra\xE7\xE3o Skeran criadas pelos Phantoms
        para sabotagem e guerra encoberta. Elas atacam a partir das sombras, emboscando
        alvos e roubando tecnologia antes de desaparecerem novamente. Suas naves
        s\xE3o r\xE1pidas, predat\xF3rias e projetadas para semear medo tanto quanto
        destrui\xE7\xE3o. At\xE9 mesmo os outros Skeran as encaram com inquieta\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: Specialized Skeran infiltration units created by the Phantoms for
        sabotage and covert warfare. They strike from darkness, ambushing targets
        and stealing technology before disappearing again. Their ships are fast,
        predatory, and designed to spread fear as much as destruction. Even other
        Skeran regard them with unease.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Junker.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Piratas, desertores e saqueadores que vivem nos cintur\xF5es de asteroides
        em fus\xE3o do Setor 1. A maioria s\xE3o ex-cidad\xE3os do Conclave que abandonaram
        a vida militar e agora sobrevivem por meio de pilhagem e contrabando. Suas
        naves s\xE3o montadas a partir de tecnologia roubada e recuperada, mantida
        unida pela pura desespero. Em territ\xF3rio Junker, a sobreviv\xEAncia importa
        mais do que lealdade ou lei."
      baseValue: Pirates, deserters, and scavengers living within the molten asteroid
        belts of Sector 1. Most are former Conclave citizens who abandoned military
        life and now survive through raiding and smuggling. Their ships are assembled
        from stolen and salvaged technology held together through desperation. In
        Junker territory, survival matters more than loyalty or law.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Outcast.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Humanos enlouquecidos pelo uso excessivo de tecnologias experimentais
        como os Motores Temporais. Suas mentes se fragmentaram a ponto de se acreditarem
        iluminados, dotados de verdades que o resto da humanidade n\xE3o consegue
        compreender. Suas naves se movem de forma imprevis\xEDvel em combate, deslocando-se
        de fase e distorcendo o pr\xF3prio tempo. At\xE9 mesmo o Conclave teme aquilo
        em que os Outcasts se transformaram."
      baseValue: Humans driven mad through overuse of experimental technologies such
        as Temporal Drives. Their minds have fractured to the point that they believe
        themselves enlightened, gifted with truths the rest of humanity cannot grasp.
        Their ships move unpredictably through combat, phasing and distorting time
        itself. Even the Conclave fears what the Outcasts have become.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Pantheon.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Descendentes de desertores do Conclave que fugiram da Terra para construir
        uma sociedade democr\xE1tica livre do dom\xEDnio imperial. Eles acreditam
        que o Conclave se tornou obcecado por guerra e controle, sacrificando o futuro
        da humanidade no processo. Seus ideais pac\xEDficos lhes renderam uma alian\xE7a
        com os antigos Phantoms, garantindo acesso a tecnologia poderosa. O Pantheon
        se v\xEA como o futuro da humanidade."
      baseValue: "Descendants of Conclave defectors who fled Earth to build a democratic
        society free from imperial rule. They believe the Conclave has become obsessed
        with war and control, sacrificing humanity\u2019s future in the process.
        Their peaceful ideals earned them an alliance with the ancient Phantoms,
        granting access to powerful technology. The Pantheon sees itself as the future
        of mankind."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Sentinel.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Defensores de elite da Terra e for\xE7a militar pessoal do Imperador.
        Eles servem diretamente sob as ordens do Gr\xE3o-Marechal Vex, atuando como
        guarda real. Suas frotas s\xE3o pesadamente armadas, disciplinadas e completamente
        implac\xE1veis em batalha. A chegada das for\xE7as Sentinel costuma significar
        que a situa\xE7\xE3o j\xE1 se tornou cr\xEDtica."
      baseValue: "Elite defenders of Earth and the Emperor\u2019s personal military
        forces. They serve directly under Grand Marshal Vex, acting as royal guard.
        Their fleets are heavily armed, disciplined, and completely unforgiving in
        battle. The arrival of Sentinel forces usually means the situation has already
        become critical."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog1
      type: 2
      value: "Finalmente! Estamos carregando o hiperpropulsor, ajude a det\xEA-los!"
      baseValue: Finally! We're charging the hyperdrive, help hold them off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog2
      type: 2
      value: "Gra\xE7as ao Imperador. Sairemos daqui rapidinho, \xE9 s\xF3 segurar
        eles!"
      baseValue: Thank the Emperor. We'll be out of here in no time just hold them
        off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog3
      type: 2
      value: Temos mais inimigos chegando. Cuidado!
      baseValue: We have more hostiles incoming. Watch out!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog4
      type: 2
      value: "Eles est\xE3o se preparando para um ataque maior. Preparem-se!"
      baseValue: They're gearing up for a bigger attack. Get ready!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA est\xE1 invadindo o espa\xE7o Skeran. Saia agora ou ser\xE1
        destru\xEDdo!"
      baseValue: You are trespassing in Skeran space. Leave now, or be destroyed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Direto \xE0s amea\xE7as. Encantador."
      baseValue: Straight to the threats. Charming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Eles n\xE3o est\xE3o blefando."
      baseValue: They're not bluffing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o, n\xE3o s\xE3o. Prepare-se..."
      baseValue: No, they're not. Get ready...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Impressionante. Voc\xEA lutou at\xE9 aqui, mas precisar\xE1 lutar ainda
        mais para chegar \xE0 Terra."
      baseValue: Impressive. You've fought your way this far, but you'll need to
        fight harder to reach Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Considere isso um s\xEDmbolo do meu... apoio."
      baseValue: Consider this a token of my... support.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Por qu\xEA? Por que nos ajudar?"
      baseValue: Why? Why help us?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ajuda? N\xE3o. Estou gerenciando uma vari\xE1vel. Voc\xEA acabou se
        beneficiando."
      baseValue: Help? No. I'm managing a variable. You just happen to benefit.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA s\xF3 tem um caminho. Lute para seguir em frente."
      baseValue: You have only one path. Fight your way forward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Suas vit\xF3rias n\xE3o significam nada. N\xF3s seremos vitoriosos!"
      baseValue: Your wins mean nothing. We will be victorious!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Parece que eles n\xE3o t\xEAm fim..."
      baseValue: There seems to be no end to them...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "S\xE3o implac\xE1veis, uma ra\xE7a guerreira criada para a guerra."
      baseValue: They're relentless, a warrior race built for war.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA ousa desafiar o poder dos Skeran? Voc\xEA nunca chegar\xE1
        \xE0 Cidadela!"
      baseValue: You dare challenge the might of the Skeran? You will never reach
        the Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "Os Phantoms n\xE3o conseguiram nos derrotar, voc\xEA tamb\xE9m n\xE3o
        conseguir\xE1!"
      baseValue: The Phantoms could not defeat us, neither will you!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "Grandes palavras para uma esp\xE9cie prestes a perder outra luta."
      baseValue: Big words for a species about to lose another fight.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Droga, uma emboscada, preparem-se para...
      baseValue: Damn, an ambush prepare to...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.1
      type: 2
      value: O que... o que aconteceu?
      baseValue: What... what just happened?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nossos sensores nem perceberam. Que tipo de energia ela est\xE1 usando?"
      baseValue: That didn't even register on our sensors. What kind of power is
        she using?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Aceite isso como uma recompensa por escolher o caminho mais dif\xEDcil."
      baseValue: Take this as a reward for choosing the harder path.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Por que voc\xEA est\xE1 fazendo isso?"
      baseValue: Why are you doing this?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Digamos apenas que esse caminho beneficia a n\xF3s dois."
      baseValue: Let's just say this path benefits us both.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA realmente espera que confiemos nisso?"
      baseValue: You really expect us to trust that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.7
      type: 2
      value: "Confian\xE7a? N\xE3o. Mas o pr\xF3ximo passo \xE9 claro. Seu caminho
        para casa est\xE1 cheio de inimigos, e voc\xEA precisar\xE1 de mais do que
        perguntas para sobreviver."
      baseValue: Trust? No. But the next step is clear. Your way home is littered
        with enemies, and you'll need more than questions to survive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "O Conclave retorna, apegado aos seus velhos costumes. Voc\xEA algum
        dia aprender\xE1?"
      baseValue: The Conclave returns, clinging to its old ways. Will you ever learn?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Fantasmas s\xE3o exatamente o que se espera de uma ra\xE7a imortal.
        Arrogantes, condescendentes... apaixonados por mon\xF3logos."
      baseValue: Phantoms are exactly what you'd expect from an immortal race. Arrogant,
        condescending... fond of monologues.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o \xE9 bem um convite para um ch\xE1, n\xE3o \xE9?"
      baseValue: Not exactly inviting us to tea, are they?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Sua ra\xE7a s\xF3 conhece a guerra. N\xE3o deixaremos que voc\xEAs
        a tragam para c\xE1."
      baseValue: Your kind knows only war. We will not let you bring it here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Aqueles que constru\xEDram os portais nunca entenderam o sofrimento
        que trariam."
      baseValue: The ones who built the gateways never understood the suffering they'd
        bring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Sofrimento? Dos Portais?
      baseValue: Suffering? From the Gateways?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Vasculharam as estrelas e s\xF3 encontraram sil\xEAncio... ent\xE3o
        criaram vida para preencher o vazio."
      baseValue: They scoured the stars and found only silence... so they made life
        to fill the emptiness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Mas seus preciosos portais iluminaram o vazio... cegando o que nunca
        deveria ter visto a luz.
      baseValue: But their precious gateways lit up the void... blinding what should
        never have seen the light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vimos in\xFAmeras civiliza\xE7\xF5es surgirem e ca\xEDrem, e suas cinzas
        serem espalhadas pelas estrelas."
      baseValue: We have seen countless civilizations rise and fall, their ashes
        scattered across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "O Conclave n\xE3o ser\xE1 diferente."
      baseValue: The Conclave will be no different.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA fala como se estivesse por a\xED h\xE1 uma eternidade."
      baseValue: You sound like you've been around forever.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Assistimos ao nascimento e \xE0 morte de estrelas, \xE0 queda de tiranos
        que se consideravam eternos."
      baseValue: We have watched the birth and death of stars, the fall of tyrants
        who thought themselves eternal.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o pense que voc\xEA vai nos quebrar t\xE3o facilmente quanto fez
        com nossos animais de estima\xE7\xE3o desobedientes."
      baseValue: Do not think you will break us as easily as you did our disobedient
        pets.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.5
      type: 2
      value: "Ent\xE3o coloque-nos na sua lista de ca\xEDdos... e veja o que acontece
        a seguir."
      baseValue: Then put us on your list of fallen... and watch what happens next.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA vai precisar disto."
      baseValue: You'll need this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Por que?
      baseValue: Why?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Esta n\xE3o \xE9 a parte em que voc\xEA morre. Isso vem depois."
      baseValue: This isn't the part where you die. That comes later.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Encantador...
      baseValue: Delightful...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Pelo menos n\xE3o est\xE1 mais falando em enigmas!"
      baseValue: At least it's not speaking in riddles anymore!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA exerce poder sem entender seu custo."
      baseValue: You wield power without understanding its cost.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.1
      type: 2
      value: "N\xF3s lidamos com tudo que voc\xEAs jogaram contra n\xF3s at\xE9 agora."
      baseValue: We've handled everything you've thrown at us so far.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.2
      type: 2
      value: Somente porque permitimos!
      baseValue: Only because we allow it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.3
      type: 2
      value: "Os Skeran foram cria\xE7\xF5es nossas... houve outros, muito maiores,
        perdidos no tempo"
      baseValue: The Skeran were our creations... there were others, far greater,
        lost to time
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.4
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA luta pelo controle de uma gal\xE1xia que n\xF3s moldamos, sem
        nunca questionar as ru\xEDnas sob seus p\xE9s."
      baseValue: You fight for control of a galaxy we shaped, never questioning the
        ruins beneath your feet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vire-se, animal. N\xE3o traga o Convocador do Vazio para c\xE1."
      baseValue: Turn back, animal. Do not bring the Void Caller here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "E quem \xE9 exatamente?"
      baseValue: And who exactly is that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Os lacaios dela perseguem voc\xEA agora mesmo. Vamos acabar com voc\xEA
        antes que eles cheguem."
      baseValue: Her minions pursue you even now. We will remove you before they
        arrive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Eu encontrei isso.
      baseValue: I found this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ah, voc\xEA est\xE1 nos ajudando de novo?"
      baseValue: Oh, you're helping us again?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Sozinho, voc\xEA fracassou. Juntos, ainda podemos progredir."
      baseValue: Alone, you floundered. Together we may yet make progress.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1 criticando sua mira porque sua mira \xE9 ruim..."
      baseValue: It's judging your aiming because your aiming is bad...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sua polui\xE7\xE3o se espalha por todo o nosso jardim."
      baseValue: Your pollution spreads throughout our garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Polui\xE7\xE3o? Tenho esses propulsores funcionando com quase 0,5%
        de emiss\xF5es..."
      baseValue: Pollution? I've got these thrusters running at nearly 0.5% emissions...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Acho que era uma met\xE1fora. Achei que voc\xEA tivesse entendido?"
      baseValue: I think that was a metaphor. I thought you understood those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ah, certo, n\xF3s somos a polui\xE7\xE3o... entendi!"
      baseValue: Oh right, we're the pollution... got it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nave Conclave, voc\xEA alegrou o nosso dia. Desligue e vamos fazer
        isso r\xE1pido."
      baseValue: Conclave ship, you just made our day. Power down and we'll make
        this quick.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ador\xE1veis. Piratas com ambi\xE7\xE3o... e zero instinto de autopreserva\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: Lovely. Pirates with ambition... and zero self-preservation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA incendiou nossa tripula\xE7\xE3o. Estamos aqui para retribuir
        o favor... com juros."
      baseValue: You torched our crew. We're here to return the favor... with interest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o, esses cabe\xE7as-duras de novo. Eles reaparecem ou apenas se
        multiplicam?"
      baseValue: Not these meatheads again. Do they respawn, or just multiply?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Eu caminhei atrav\xE9s do ontem... e voltei do amanh\xE3."
      baseValue: I have walked through yesterday... and returned from tomorrow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Fant\xE1stico. Viciados temporais com complexo de deus."
      baseValue: Fantastic. Temporal junkies with a god complex.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "O que eles est\xE3o buscando?"
      baseValue: What are they even after?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Transcend\xEAncia... ou talvez uma sess\xE3o de medita\xE7\xE3o em
        grupo no fim dos tempos."
      baseValue: Transcendence... or maybe a group meditation session at the end
        of time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA est\xE1 preso no presente... e o futuro n\xE3o quer mais voc\xEA."
      baseValue: You are trapped in the present... and the future no longer wants
        you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xC9 a Deriva Temporal falando. A mente deles est\xE1 bagun\xE7ada."
      baseValue: That's the Temporal Drift talking. Their minds are scrambled.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "N\xF3s ouvimos voc\xEA, fantasma tiquetaqueante! Seus pensamentos lineares
        revelam sua fraqueza!"
      baseValue: We hear you, ticking ghost! Your linear thoughts betray your weakness!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Espera... eles conseguem me ouvir? N\xE3o \xE9 assim que deveria funcionar."
      baseValue: Wait... they can hear me? That's not how this is supposed to work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Sa\xEDmos do seu tempo. Voc\xEA n\xE3o consegue captar o que j\xE1
        aconteceu."
      baseValue: We've stepped outside your time. You can't catch what's already
        happened.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA vagueia onde a luz n\xE3o alcan\xE7a... e n\xE3o v\xEA o que
        se segue."
      baseValue: You wander where the light does not reach... and do not see what
        follows.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Enigm\xE1tico e perturbador. Exatamente o que eu esperava."
      baseValue: Cryptic and unsettling. Just what I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "A ca\xE7ada j\xE1 acabou."
      baseValue: The hunt is already over.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Acho que essa \xE9 a maneira deles dizerem que estamos em apuros."
      baseValue: I think that's their way of saying we're in trouble.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Esse conhecimento nunca foi destinado a voc\xEA."
      baseValue: This knowledge was never meant for you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Parece que est\xE3o vasculhando... provavelmente tecnologia Phantom."
      baseValue: Sounds like they're scavenging... probably Phantom tech.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xD3timo. Mais armas roubadas para se voltarem contra n\xF3s."
      baseValue: Great. More stolen weapons to turn against us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Uma nave solit\xE1ria... desencaminhada por for\xE7as al\xE9m da sua
        compreens\xE3o."
      baseValue: A lone ship... led astray by forces beyond their understanding.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Eu nem sei quem voc\xEA \xE9..."
      baseValue: I don't even know who you are...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Claro que n\xE3o. Seus mestres apagam muitas coisas da sua hist\xF3ria."
      baseValue: Of course you don't. Your masters erase many things from your history.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.3
      type: 2
      value: Nos afastamos da tirania deles. Agora nos erguemos com verdadeiros poderes.
      baseValue: We walked away from their tyranny. Now we stand with true powers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Fantasmas? Voc\xEA trocou um mestre por outro..."
      baseValue: Phantoms? You traded one master for another...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Um mestre exige obedi\xEAncia... um mentor compartilha sabedoria."
      baseValue: A master demands obedience... a mentor shares wisdom.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "O fantasma do vazio pode te levar para casa... mas n\xE3o por sua causa."
      baseValue: The ghost from the void may lead you home... but not for your sake.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "O que voc\xEA sabe sobre fantasmas?"
      baseValue: What do you know of ghosts?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Que at\xE9 os mais velhos entre n\xF3s sabem temer a escurid\xE3o."
      baseValue: That even the oldest among us know to fear the darkness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA pisa em sombras antigas, pe\xE3o do Conclave."
      baseValue: You step into ancient shadows, Conclave pawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Mais Phantoms? Voc\xEA n\xE3o parece com os outros."
      baseValue: More Phantoms? You don't sound like the rest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o somos os seus remanescentes. Somos a sua perfei\xE7\xE3o."
      baseValue: We are not their remnants. We are their perfection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ajoelhe-se ou ser\xE1 desfeito."
      baseValue: Kneel, or be unmade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA usa as correntes dos seus mestres como medalhas."
      baseValue: You wear your masters' chains like medals.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Melhor do que adorar as ru\xEDnas de um imp\xE9rio falido."
      baseValue: Better than worshipping the ruins of a failed empire.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Eles n\xE3o s\xE3o apenas iludidos... eles s\xE3o nost\xE1lgicos e
        perigosos."
      baseValue: They're not just deluded... they're nostalgic and dangerous.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o veneramos o passado. N\xF3s o corrigimos."
      baseValue: We do not worship the past. We correct it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vaso humano. Estrutura gen\xE9tica confirmada. Preparar para coleta."
      baseValue: Human vessel. Genetic structure confirmed. Prepare for collection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Espera. Isso \xE9... estamos mesmo sendo abduzidos?"
      baseValue: Wait. Is this... are we actually getting abducted?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Grays. Claro, s\xE3o os Grays. Devia ter trazido um chap\xE9u de papel
        alum\xEDnio."
      baseValue: Grays. Of course, it's Grays. Should've brought a tinfoil hat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "N\xE3o resista. A ades\xE3o garante perda m\xEDnima de tecido."
      baseValue: Do not resist. Compliance ensures minimal tissue loss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sujeito continua n\xE3o cooperando. Prosseguindo com protocolo de conten\xE7\xE3o
        secund\xE1ria."
      baseValue: Subject remains noncompliant. Proceeding with secondary containment
        protocol.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Voc\xEA n\xE3o est\xE1 mesmo ainda tentando me abduzir?"
      baseValue: You're not seriously still trying to abduct me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE3o sim. E a julgar pelo pico do scanner... trouxeram um pote
        maior."
      baseValue: They are. And judging by the scanner spike... they brought a bigger
        jar.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Danos aos tecidos s\xE3o aceit\xE1veis. Iniciar a colheita."
      baseValue: Tissue damage acceptable. Begin harvest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
